We can't do this!

251
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:58,950
Stop!

252
00:15:14,660 --> 00:15:16,080
Couldn't do it, huh?

253
00:15:16,680 --> 00:15:18,320
White lightning attack!

254
00:15:22,860 --> 00:15:24,580
I can't believe it!

255
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:27,380
That underhanded
sleazeball wiped Yugi out!

256
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:29,310
Oh!

257
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:46,940
Master Pegasus, just now the battle
between Yugi and Kaiba was decided.

258
00:15:47,580 --> 00:15:49,280
Seto Kaiba was the victor.

259
00:15:49,920 --> 00:15:50,920
Thank you, Kimo.

260
00:15:51,740 --> 00:15:55,280
Shall I allow Seto Kaiba to
enter the castle then, sir?

261
00:15:55,920 --> 00:15:59,420
Yes, a deal is a deal. Done. Right away.

262
00:16:01,060 --> 00:16:02,960
Good job, Kaiba boy.

263
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:05,397
As you wished, I will
be your next opponent.

264
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:10,560
But little Yugi didn't fare nearly so well
in this rematch between the two of you.

265
00:16:11,040 --> 00:16:12,620
His spirit is broken.

266
00:16:13,560 --> 00:16:16,860
And his grandfather's soul remains. Mine!

267
00:16:26,120 --> 00:16:27,700
What's going on here?

268
00:16:28,060 --> 00:16:31,977
That punk Yugi could have won the
game, but he threw it away to Kaiba.

269
00:16:32,060 --> 00:16:34,297
Who ever heard of a duelist doing that?

270
00:16:34,380 --> 00:16:35,260
Yugi!

271
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:38,640
It's okay, man.

272
00:16:41,400 --> 00:16:43,360
I almost couldn't control it.

273
00:16:43,700 --> 00:16:46,080
This other presence deep inside me.

274
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:49,365
He was willing to go all
the way against Kaiba.

275
00:16:49,580 --> 00:16:51,540
Another presence inside you?

276
00:16:51,740 --> 00:16:52,740
What do you mean?

277
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:54,857
What the heck are you
talking about, buddy?

278
00:16:54,940 --> 00:16:58,440
Like me, Yugi has some sort
of ancient spirit inside him.

279
00:16:58,540 --> 00:17:00,837
It has something to do
with our Millennium Items.

280
00:17:00,920 --> 00:17:03,697
I'm afraid of this spirit inside me.

281
00:17:03,780 --> 00:17:06,620
So afraid that I will never duel again.

282
00:17:08,660 --> 00:17:09,520
I'm sorry.

283
00:17:10,440 --> 00:17:11,911
Sorry about your grandpa.

284
00:17:12,180 --> 00:17:13,827
But you did the right thing.

285
00:17:13,960 --> 00:17:17,195
You couldn't hurt another
person, not even to save him.

286
00:17:18,580 --> 00:17:20,697
He wouldn't want to be saved that way.

287
00:17:20,780 --> 00:17:22,697
Then I guess he got what he wanted.

288
00:17:22,780 --> 00:17:27,620
If Yugi had done what needed to be done,
he would be entering the castle, not me.

289
00:17:28,080 --> 00:17:30,937
But he was too weak to
follow through on his play.

290
00:17:31,020 --> 00:17:32,020
He spared you!

291
00:17:33,780 --> 00:17:37,337
Kaiba, he's showed you compassion,
which is more than you deserve.

292
00:17:37,420 --> 00:17:39,640
He lost the game. The game?

293
00:17:40,260 --> 00:17:43,037
Yugi may have lost one
lousy duel monster's game,

294
00:17:43,120 --> 00:17:44,977
but at least he hasn't lost his heart.

295
00:17:45,060 --> 00:17:46,920
Not like you, Seto Kaiba.

296
00:17:47,260 --> 00:17:49,257
You've spent so much
time with your machines,

297
00:17:49,340 --> 00:17:51,869
you've forgotten what
being human is about.

298
00:17:52,820 --> 00:17:54,340
Yugi has a heart, Kaiba.

299
00:17:54,700 --> 00:17:55,720
Yugi has us.

300
00:17:56,060 --> 00:17:58,157
Friends that'll stand with him to the end,

301
00:17:58,240 --> 00:18:01,077
no matter whether he wins
or loses some lousy game.

302
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:03,180
And what do you have, Seto Kaiba?

303
00:18:04,080 --> 00:18:08,260
What do you have at the end
of the day? Tell me! Tell me!

304
00:18:10,700 --> 00:18:12,520
I have all that I need.

305
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:19,160
Yeah, keep fooling yourself, Kaiba.

306
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:21,518
Yugi's twice the man you'll ever be.

307
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:25,146
Well, that was a fun way
to spend the morning.

308
00:18:27,280 --> 00:18:31,740
Your ten starships qualify you
to enter the Inner Sanctum.

309
00:18:33,300 --> 00:18:35,140
At last, I'm in,

310
00:18:35,380 --> 00:18:40,740
and I'm ready to face you,
Pegasus, once and for all.
